### Training data

The upstream authors trained these weights on research datasets (WIDER FACE
for RetinaFace, WebFace260M/WebFace4M for AdaFace) whose own terms are limited
to non-commercial research. The authors released the resulting **weights**
under MIT and state no further restriction, and UniFace's licence page lists
both as MIT. This notice records that provenance so downstream users can make
their own judgement; it is not legal advice.

If you need a stack with no dataset ambiguity, EdgeFace (BSD-3-Clause, Idiap
Research Institute) and OpenCV YuNet (MIT) are drop-in alternatives.

